# Stable spec ID: iba-john-collins. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(gin) 45 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 30 ml
(simple syrup) 15 ml
(soda water) 60 ml

::equipment
(highball glass)

::instructions
{drink} = (gin) + (lemon: juice, fresh) + (simple syrup) + (soda water)
{drink} <pour, into (highball glass) filled with ice> <stir, gently>
<garnish, with lemon slice and maraschino cherry>

::notes
The source labels the Old Tom gin version Tom Collins: a named variant, not a silent alias.
